From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Isaac J. Manjarres" <isaacmanjarres@google.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jan 2025 14:59:07 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] ANDROID: mm: shmem: Use memfd-ashmem-shim ioctl handler

Local Linux 7.3 port of the Android common-patches change at
95c6537fa2f92733e8b9fe23ab4ace2446070f41.

Keep the memfd compatibility handler without depending on ASHMEM_C or the
separate Android ASHMEM_RUST driver. Preserve Linux 7.3's mmap_prepare and
setlease operations. Enable the shim in the device configuration rather
than changing its global Kconfig default.

Origin: Android common-patches; locally adapted for Linux 7.3
Source: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common-patches/+/95c6537fa2f92733e8b9fe23ab4ace2446070f41/android-mainline/ANDROID-mm-shmem-Use-memfd-ashmem-shim-ioctl-handler.patch
License: GPL-2.0 (kernel sources)
Base-commit: 755ffc44d5d8442adeec8bbaa02108478089c4d7
Apply in filename order within this project.

Bug: 111903542
Bug: 415769373
Change-Id: I0bf57ac5a90dba66e5c2c32beff70bcf9d26db6b
Signed-off-by: Isaac J. Manjarres <isaacmanjarres@google.com>

---
diff --git a/mm/shmem.c b/mm/shmem.c
index 848316eaa7f4fb84c6eb8304c3015978483f419c..371f41fd945fb8e56eed1d36d21201450b9bac09 100644
--- a/mm/shmem.c
+++ b/mm/shmem.c
@@ -87,6 +87,10 @@ static struct vfsmount *shm_mnt __ro_after_init;
 
 #include "internal.h"
 
+#ifdef CONFIG_MEMFD_ASHMEM_SHIM
+#include "memfd-ashmem-shim.h"
+#endif
+
 #define VM_ACCT(size)    (PAGE_ALIGN(size) >> PAGE_SHIFT)
 
 /* Pretend that each entry is of this size in directory's i_size */
@@ -5187,6 +5191,12 @@ static const struct file_operations shmem_file_operations = {
 	.fallocate	= shmem_fallocate,
 	.setlease	= generic_setlease,
 #endif
+#ifdef CONFIG_MEMFD_ASHMEM_SHIM
+	.unlocked_ioctl	= memfd_ashmem_shim_ioctl,
+#ifdef CONFIG_COMPAT
+	.compat_ioctl	= memfd_ashmem_shim_compat_ioctl,
+#endif
+#endif
 };
 
 static const struct inode_operations shmem_inode_operations = {
